flowchart LR
  Agent[Go origin agent] -->|HTTPS telemetry| API[ALB and ECS API]
  API --> State[(DynamoDB and S3)]
  API --> Queue[SQS and DLQ]
  Queue --> Worker[ECS worker]
  Worker --> Bedrock[Bedrock inspect and recommend]
  Worker --> CDS[EUM Social and SES]
  CDS --> Human[Operator review]
  Human -->|WhatsApp or optional signed email| SNS[SNS]
  SNS --> Queue
  Worker -->|Validated approval| State
  State -->|Command polling through API| Agent
  Agent -->|Applied / removed / expired| API
